<node id="Web Application">
  <data key="d0">Web Application</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Web Application: A software system accessible via HTTP or HTTPS protocols, functioning as a server-side application that receives HTTP requests and constructs or serves dynamic content. It operates within a web service environment, potentially spanning multiple IP addresses or virtual hosts while functioning under a single domain or IP context. The system integrates backend components such as databases, directory services via LDAP, and XML handling systems to process user inputs and generate rendered content. As a web-facing software program, it exposes functionalities and associated vulnerabilities, including susceptibility to injection attacks like SQL injection, improper data handling, HTML injection through input/output points, risks from HTTP-based file access via filename-based resolution, and token management weaknesses in OAuth-enabled services or WSTG-IDNT-04 scope violations in authentication systems. Serving as a primary target for search engines and security assessments, this application tier handles user input, directs database queries, and delivers HTTP responses containing headers to regular users. It also acts as the target system environment for testing input validation, inoculated attack vectors, and overall resilience against privilege escalation, data exposure, and unauthorized access.&lt;SEP&gt;The target application or site being tested for session management vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A web application that maintains session state using cookies or HTTP authentication without adequate anti-CSRF protection.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side application handling HTTP requests and maintaining user session state through cookies and authentication mechanisms.&lt;SEP&gt;An online system under test that manages user sessions and sensitive data.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2efb3aacf8e172b84b6e1793e84eff76-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2efb3aacf8e172b84b6e1793e84eff76-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-db3753bb1b28c5b9ebe5769dc9c06af2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ab2f517f1c742be6f3d510cb76dc6940-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5bb2d236b1e2b43118e82283180ff198-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-eff998e21395157f6ed4ce495ef006aa-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-99ca68306b054ccf1d7b5816bafb1048-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7d44ae2e3796fb2811788a45b296b379-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-507feea21a2b9071c451f23d5f3c743d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5d55d44f25265c54469eaa8333ead2a4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5a256f4ddf984161f5cbf651e65af470-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-92b67b99fc7587fc9af9d2208dfa4918-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8b308a52fdeb6c7f9a9a2dce9ca1cae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d9258074adf66922ee55cf68a3d1139-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1fdc50b475aa40c6258b79abf9a867a6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1fdc50b475aa40c6258b79abf9a867a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-40abae0a95ecce566511731ae40acbbf-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3be59af692385f8910776899901b815f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3be59af692385f8910776899901b815f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e673fd83bcb14789984668dec20fbae1-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8572f501a826eda55dfbb3563ca66b07-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-94f308342598cce2ab79e26439b43b5f-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b515367113bce44cf3564abc5019508d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b515367113bce44cf3564abc5019508d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b515367113bce44cf3564abc5019508d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b71020ce840e0a943e1deda0b9f2c41-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2df0461e7868bf356c8b0363fdfc1a8b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35af4670be2579d771f8aacc9dfbff92-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35af4670be2579d771f8aacc9dfbff92-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0494a6f833c36d4bb797a335271d7b57-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-athz-01-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-05-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-06-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-09-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-07-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-12-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-athz-03-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-athz-05-2-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-clnt-03-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-conf-03-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-cryp-03-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-idnt-04-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-info-01-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-info-04-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-info-06-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-info-08-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-04-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-05-3-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-13-13-testing-for-format-string-injection-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-14-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-15-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-sess-03-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-sess-05-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-sess-11-methodology.md</data>
