  <data key="d0">PHP</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A scripting language and runtime environment often found on web servers and embedded in web content.&lt;SEP&gt;A web application server-side scripting language that, when improperly used with MongoDB operators, can be manipulated via injection through valid variable names like `$where`.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side scripting language commonly used by web applications and frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;The programming language whose code processing behavior is impacted by file inclusion functions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a2a918bb83307307b4812469ae0001c-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4bbd60ae8a8276a511522c70e38b3d51-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1fdc50b475aa40c6258b79abf9a867a6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3145270b6ffe0fd7611c4610be0770a9-chunk-002</data>
