  <data key="d5">1785416575</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Web Application Firewall">
  <data key="d0">Web Application Firewall</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A network-based control that examines incoming traffic, including user input, to block malicious payloads before reaching the web application.&lt;SEP&gt;A network security device or application layer filter that inspects and blocks malicious requests to prevent SQL injection attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;A network security device that filters traffic, often used to block request patterns such as excessive or malicious queries.&lt;SEP&gt;A target control that filters suspicious requests before application logic receives them.&lt;SEP&gt;Target defense mechanism that filters or blocks requests based on attributes including HTTP method.&lt;SEP&gt;Target security control that may filter or obscure duplicated parameter behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a2a918bb83307307b4812469ae0001c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f4e64e8a4e13f14c3ff3f3f15491570-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f4e64e8a4e13f14c3ff3f3f15491570-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc774259228cd414282425d0a281e37-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4fc774259228cd414282425d0a281e37-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3be59af692385f8910776899901b815f-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3be59af692385f8910776899901b815f-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-01-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-05-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-apit-99-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-conf-06-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-inpv-04-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785580881</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Input Validation Control">
  <data key="d0">Input Validation Control</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A mechanism within or surrounding the web application that checks and sanitizes user input before processing or rendering it.&lt;SEP&gt;A mechanism within the web application that checks or filters user input before storing or displaying it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a2a918bb83307307b4812469ae0001c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-40abae0a95ecce566511731ae40acbbf-chunk-004</data>
