  <data key="d0">Reflected Cross Site Scripting (XSS)</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness in web applications where untrusted user input is placed into web pages before encoding/escaping, enabling attacker-controlled scripts to execute in browsers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-9a2a918bb83307307b4812469ae0001c-chunk-001</data>
