</node>
<node id="Inband">
  <data key="d0">Inband</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">A SQL injection attack variant where data is extracted through the same channel used to inject the SQL code, presenting retrieved data directly in the web page.</data>
