  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">A SQL injection attack variant where data is extracted using a different channel from the original injection, such as sending query results via email to the tester.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique that extracts data using external channels like network connections, rather than directly from the application response.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-001</data>
