<node id="Database Error Message">
  <data key="d0">Database Error Message</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A response that reveals database structure, error codes, or internal SQL errors when an injection succeeds or fails.&lt;SEP&gt;Error text returned by the database engine indicating query syntax issues, incorrect column references, or datatype mismatches.&lt;SEP&gt;A web response containing database-specific error text indicating a SQL query failure.&lt;SEP&gt;An error message returned from a database that may include table names, column names, SQL constructs, database version information or backend structure details.&lt;SEP&gt;A response containing database-specific error details that may reveal schema or internal server information.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d8f69c7e813a7c5f87c603a15e656cb8-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7d6b66fa87709205e7e043782f3a891-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a7d6b66fa87709205e7e043782f3a891-chunk-000</data>
