  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A protocol used to store information about users, hosts, and other objects.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db3753bb1b28c5b9ebe5769dc9c06af2-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-06-methodology.md</data>
