</node>
<node id="Always True LDAP Expression">
  <data key="d0">Always True LDAP Expression</data>
  <data key="d1">PayloadPattern</data>
  <data key="d2">A reusable malicious input pattern such as `(cn=*)` that exploits logical operator short-circuiting to bypass authentication.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-db3753bb1b28c5b9ebe5769dc9c06af2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-06-methodology.md</data>
