<node id="XPath Injection">
  <data key="d0">XPath Injection</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">A flaw where user-controlled data is passed to an XPath expression without proper sanitization, allowing attackers to manipulate query results or bypass logic.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where improper input validation allows crafted XPath syntax to alter query logic.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where user-controlled input is improperly handled within XPath queries, allowing attackers to manipulate data selection.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ab2f517f1c742be6f3d510cb76dc6940-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ab2f517f1c742be6f3d510cb76dc6940-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ab2f517f1c742be6f3d510cb76dc6940-chunk-002</data>
