  <data key="d0">XML Database</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A database system that stores data in XML format and uses XPath for querying data from such documents.&lt;SEP&gt;A database system that stores data using the XML format and uses XPath for querying.</data>
