  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A XML structure (`&lt;![CDATA[...]]&gt;`) that escapes markup characters to treat them as plain text.&lt;SEP&gt;A block of text in XML enclosed in `&lt;![CDATA[` and `]]&gt;` that escapes character interpretations within an XML document context.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5bb2d236b1e2b43118e82283180ff198-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5bb2d236b1e2b43118e82283180ff198-chunk-005</data>
