<node id="GraphQL API">
  <data key="d0">GraphQL API</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A web service architecture that uses GraphQL for client-server data queries.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific web API framework that uses the GraphQL query language to define schemas and return data.&lt;SEP&gt;A query-based web API technology where clients define their exact data requirements using a schema-defined query syntax.&lt;SEP&gt;Query language and runtime system for APIs providing flexible data schemas&lt;SEP&gt;A query language for APIs that uses a single endpoint and client-driven data specification via ID arguments and query syntax.&lt;SEP&gt;An API query and mutation framework that uses typed schemas and field explorations to interact with backend services.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-366fc7951a16dd549e3f1dc83417fabe-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f4e64e8a4e13f14c3ff3f3f15491570-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1564e3d5f1827a65b9154317ee688371-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1564e3d5f1827a65b9154317ee688371-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1838f0008a46f27b66d8dac8325a6a1e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1838f0008a46f27b66d8dac8325a6a1e-chunk-000</data>
