<node id="Broken Object-Level Authorization">
  <data key="d0">Broken Object-Level Authorization</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness where access controls do not restrict a user from retrieving or modifying another object's data.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness where the API does not enforce user permission scope on deeply nested object access.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness in GraphQL where object access checks do not effectively enforce user permissions at the object level.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness where access control checks fail for individual objects accessible via identifiers, allowing unauthorized access across accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where object access checks fail to enforce a user's authorization scope for specific items.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-5f4e64e8a4e13f14c3ff3f3f15491570-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f4e64e8a4e13f14c3ff3f3f15491570-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5f4e64e8a4e13f14c3ff3f3f15491570-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1838f0008a46f27b66d8dac8325a6a1e-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1838f0008a46f27b66d8dac8325a6a1e-chunk-000</data>
