  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A feature or security control that temporarily or permanently restricts account access after a defined number of unsuccessful authentication attempts.&lt;SEP&gt;A security control that restricts access after a defined number of consecutive failed authentication attempts.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side control that restricts account access after consecutive failed authentication attempts.</data>
