  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">Cross-Site Request Forgery, a request that appears valid because it originates from a trusted source while performing actions unauthorized for the user.&lt;SEP&gt;Forces the user’s browser to execute unauthorized actions on a target site using the user's legitimate session.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e7b9806d7dfaeb2a86d3d73ea8317aef-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e7b9806d7dfaeb2a86d3d73ea8317aef-chunk-000</data>
