<node id="Password Reset Link">
  <data key="d0">Password Reset Link</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A URL-based interface provided by applications to allow users to reset their accounts via token-based or identifier-based parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;A URL containing a token sent in email to allow a user to reset their account credentials.&lt;SEP&gt;A generated temporary URL sent via email that contains server-side parameters including an unprotected Host header value, which can be modified by an attacker.</data>
