  <data key="d0">Consent Page</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">The user interface displayed to confirm that a Resource Owner consents to client access to a resource.&lt;SEP&gt;User interface presented to the resource owner to request permission for a client to access scopes.</data>
