  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The HTTP POST request to the token endpoint containing the authorization code and parameters for exchanging it for an access token.&lt;SEP&gt;HTTP POST request payload containing client credentials, authorization code, and code verification data sent to `/oauth/token` endpoint.</data>
