  <data key="d2">Proper CORS configuration limits access of external resources to prevent XSS from reaching sensitive API endpoints.&lt;SEP&gt;Injection of malicious JavaScript into a cross-site attack context via malformed HTTP response(s) cached and served to legitimate users.</data>
