  <data key="d0">Single-Page Application (SPA)</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A web application delivered to the client via a single HTML page where most logic resides in the browser.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7d44ae2e3796fb2811788a45b296b379-chunk-002</data>
