<node id="Authorization Server">
  <data key="d0">Authorization Server</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Endpoint that issues tokens and validates client credentials during OAuth handshake.&lt;SEP&gt;The central server that holds authorization information and issues access tokens.&lt;SEP&gt;Server that manages access to protected resources based on authentication and permission data; issues tokens to clients.&lt;SEP&gt;A server that issues access tokens, handles user authentication, and manages the OAuth/OIDC protocol flow.&lt;SEP&gt;The server that performs token issuance and manages authentication and authorization workflows.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7d44ae2e3796fb2811788a45b296b379-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-athz-05-2-methodology.md&lt;SEP&gt;wstg-athz-05-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785494595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Implicit Flow">
  <data key="d0">Implicit Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">An OAuth grant type that returns an access token directly in the authorization response instead of issuing an authorization code.&lt;SEP&gt;A deprecated OAuth flow that returns an access token in the redirect URI query parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific OAuth authorization flow that does not exchange a code but directly returns the access token in the response.&lt;SEP&gt;Obsolete authorization grant method where access token information is returned directly to the client without an authorization code exchange.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness in OAuth flows where access tokens are returned to the client's frontend, increasing the risk of leakage compared to the Authorization Code Flow.&lt;SEP&gt;A deprecated OAuth authorization grant flow, though still viable within Open ID Connect (OIDC) for retrieving id_tokens.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-7d44ae2e3796fb2811788a45b296b379-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-000</data>
