<node id="Confidential Client">
  <data key="d0">Confidential Client</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackerCapability</data>
  <data key="d2">Type of Client that can securely protect and use its registration secret (e.g., backend services).&lt;SEP&gt;Type of client that can securely keep authentication secrets and prove its identity to the Authorization Server.&lt;SEP&gt;A client application that stores credentials securely and makes requests on its own behalf (server-side).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-000</data>
