<node id="Resource Server">
  <data key="d0">Resource Server</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">The application server that serves the resource content requested by the Client.&lt;SEP&gt;Server that hosts protected resources and validates access tokens issued by the Authorization Server before granting access.&lt;SEP&gt;Target server or endpoint that handles requests protected by access tokens; returns the requested resource if the token is valid.&lt;SEP&gt;The server that exposes protected resources and validates access tokens presented by clients.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-000</data>
