  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">An open authorization framework allowing a Client to access protected Resources on behalf of a Resource Owner using tokens.&lt;SEP&gt;An authorization framework allowing clients to access a user's resources on their behalf without sharing credentials.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-432cbf8013fe1cec9f0bb28ca6062ff9-chunk-000</data>
