  <data key="d2">A meta tag or HTTP response header controlling whether the referrer information is sent to the destination, used to mitigate token leakage via the referrer header.&lt;SEP&gt;A HTTP header used to control which Referrer information is allowed in requests.&lt;SEP&gt;A header controlling how much referrer information is sent along with requests.</data>
