<node id="Cross-Origin Request">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Origin Request</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">The HTTP request initiated from one origin (domain) that accesses a resource from a different domain.&lt;SEP&gt;HTTP request initiated from one origin to a resource in another origin, subject to CORS policy enforcement.&lt;SEP&gt;A request from one domain to a resource in another domain, commonly used in CSRF scenarios where the request originates from a different site than the one handling it.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d89410974592b19e283a445bd3ea68aa-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d89410974592b19e283a445bd3ea68aa-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35af4670be2579d771f8aacc9dfbff92-chunk-004</data>
