  <data key="d0">Malicious Hash Fragment Payload</data>
  <data key="d1">PayloadPattern</data>
  <data key="d2">A parameterized malicious URL fragment string containing JavaScript, external script references, or malicious content intended to be redirected or evaluated.`&lt;SEP&gt;A malicious URL fragment value containing a JavaScript injection or external resource reference designed to be loaded when the hash is extracted.`&lt;SEP&gt;A parameterized malicious URL fragment string containing JavaScript or external references intended to be loaded when the hash value is processed.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a331af288c84a3d43384e1ec0cd67904-chunk-000</data>
