<node id="Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Execution Evidence">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Execution Evidence</data>
  <data key="d1">ObservableSignal</data>
  <data key="d2">Detection through script execution behavior (e.g., JavaScript alert pop-up, DOM manipulation, reflected content)` (Description must be concise: "JavaScript alert or DOM modification indicating remote code execution").&lt;SEP&gt;Browser behavior (e.g., alert popup, DOM changes, cookie disclosure) resulting from malicious script injection caused by resource manipulation.`&lt;SEP&gt;Browser behavior such as JavaScript alerts, DOM modifications, or data disclosure resulting from injected malicious content.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a331af288c84a3d43384e1ec0cd67904-chunk-000</data>
