  <data key="d0">Malicious Origin Spoofing</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">Manipulation or injection of the Origin header in a cross-origin request to bypass CORS origin restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d89410974592b19e283a445bd3ea68aa-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-clnt-07-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785497556</data>
