<node id="Flash Player">
  <data key="d0">Flash Player</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Plugin used in browsers to execute Flash content, versioned and updated by Adobe over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Adobe's legacy plugin that contained inherent browser/Flash interaction capabilities, enabling cross-site flashing vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Adobe Flash Player runtime environment enabling ActionScript execution and providing functions like `getURL` and `navigateToURL` that can be misused if inputs are untrusted.&lt;SEP&gt;Adobe's browser plugin used to render and execute rich internet applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-fbf0208722534d321dede8c097bd3086-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbf0208722534d321dede8c097bd3086-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbf0208722534d321dede8c097bd3086-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fbf0208722534d321dede8c097bd3086-chunk-001</data>
