  <data key="d2">A Flash-unique attack where malicious Flash `.swf` content defines unsanitized functions that can be called via URL query parameters or FlashVars to leak data or interact with other domains.&lt;SEP&gt;A weakness class where improper use of Flash cross-domain loading and shared sandbox access allows flashing content from different origins.</data>
