  <data key="d2">An authenticated or interacting user providing the necessary interaction required for the clickjacking attack to succeed.&lt;SEP&gt;Someone who is induced to click the malicious link and perform an unintended action within a session.&lt;SEP&gt;The initial user account used to establish a valid session.</data>
