  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A JavaScript framework for building client-side web applications that uses a template engine to render dynamic content from the DOM.&lt;SEP&gt;A client-side web framework known for its template engine and two-way data binding, historically requiring careful input handling to prevent injection.&lt;SEP&gt;A popular front-end JavaScript framework for building web applications.</data>
