  <data key="d0">Vue.js</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A progressive JavaScript framework for building user interfaces, using templates that can be vulnerable to injection if insecurely processed.&lt;SEP&gt;A progressive frontend JavaScript framework that includes a template syntax and a runtime compiler (in older versions); sensitive use of `v-html` creates injection risks.&lt;SEP&gt;A progressive JavaScript framework for building user interfaces.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-157a4cb1972bdf9a0880f5cf18f04a6a-chunk-002</data>
