  <data key="d0">DOMPurify</data>
  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A dedicated JavaScript library used for sanitizing HTML input to remove dangerous tags, attributes, and event handlers before rendering, mitigating template injection risks.</data>
