<node id="Software Release Lifecycle">
  <data key="d0">Software Release Lifecycle</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A vendor-defined timeframe during which a software release receives support, updates, patches, and documented security advisories.</data>
