<node id="HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS)">
  <data key="d0">HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS)</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A security feature implemented via an HTTP response header that enforces HTTPS connections for a domain and its sub-domains.&lt;SEP&gt;Web security feature/technical control that forces browsers to use HTTPS connections for a domain.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e3d35387f319064504857847281b5d15-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e3d35387f319064504857847281b5d15-chunk-001</data>
