<node id="System misconfiguration">
  <data key="d0">System misconfiguration</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">A systemic configuration weakness where file system permissions for web-accessible or important assets are not set correctly according to least privilege principles.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c6e1e52bc078e006b0a0f978d9a199bc-chunk-000</data>
