<node id="Information Gathering">
  <data key="d0">Information Gathering</data>
  <data key="d1">VulnerabilityClass</data>
  <data key="d2">Strategic objective to collect platform, version, and configuration details about a web server.&lt;SEP&gt;The initial phase of testing focused on collecting target details to inform deeper attacks or vulnerability discovery.&lt;SEP&gt;An established security testing category focused on passively discovering public-facing assets, infrastructure, and exposed services preceding active exploitation or deeper probing.&lt;SEP&gt;WSTG category classifying this phase of testing as basic reconnaissance and mapping.&lt;SEP&gt;Category of cybersecurity testing phase that focuses on discovering and mapping attack surfaces and assets&lt;SEP&gt;WSTG security testing category under which the Fingerprint Web Application Framework scenario falls.&lt;SEP&gt;Category of security activities and weaknesses relevant to initial reconnaissance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-79636d7f9a295c3fa17a27c773d950df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79636d7f9a295c3fa17a27c773d950df-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-af827feaaf7735b8242b6a751ee616fa-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4d9258074adf66922ee55cf68a3d1139-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-04154921d98e923deec21047bfc2e767-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1fdc50b475aa40c6258b79abf9a867a6-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d2ff4b7186c17bdc52457e2c1f1dc3fe-chunk-001</data>
