  <data key="d2">A method where an attacker injects JavaScript, HTML, or other interpretive code into user input fields in the hope that the code will later be saved and executed by a victim.&lt;SEP&gt;Inserting XSS payloads into user-supplied input that gets stored permanently in the application's backend data store.</data>
