  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">The practice of building SQL queries by string concatenation rather than parameterized statements, enabling injection.&lt;SEP&gt;An exploitation technique that concatenates user-controlled input into SQL statements, enabling an attacker to alter query behavior without proper sanitization.</data>
