<node id="Server-Side Includes (SSI)">
  <data key="d0">Server-Side Includes (SSI)</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A server-side feature that inserts dynamic code fragments into static HTML before delivery to the client.&lt;SEP&gt;A server-side scripting feature that allows dynamic content insertion into HTML through interpreted directives before page delivery.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8572f501a826eda55dfbb3563ca66b07-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8572f501a826eda55dfbb3563ca66b07-chunk-001</data>
