<node id="JVM-based languages (Java, PHP)">
  <data key="d0">JVM-based languages (Java, PHP)</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">Languages where standard formatting libraries (`String.format`, `PrintStream.format`, `printf`) expose format string handling logic that can be abused by attackers injecting extra specifiers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-94f308342598cce2ab79e26439b43b5f-chunk-002</data>
