  <data key="d0">Web Cache</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">Intermediary storage component that may misinterpret or persist attacker-controlled responses for later request matching.&lt;SEP&gt;A shared or distributed caching layer where manipulated responses can be stored and served to any subsequent authenticating victim.</data>
