  <data key="d0">Frontend Backend Parsing Mismatch&lt;|PreconditionEnvironment|&gt;</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">A condition where frontend and backend HTTP parsers handle request boundaries or headers differently.</data>
