  <data key="d0">Connection Reuse&lt;|AttackerCapability|&gt;</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackerCapability</data>
  <data key="d2">An attacker ability to maintain or reuse network connections to extend the attack surface over multiple request batches.</data>
