  <data key="d0">Implicit Downgrade&lt;|PreconditionEnvironment|&gt;</data>
  <data key="d1">PreconditionEnvironment</data>
  <data key="d2">An environment condition where proxies silently downgrade connections to HTTP/1.1 even without explicit headers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8b6431100fb5694f9e64efa595cebe6c-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-16-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785582540</data>
