  <data key="d0">Smuggled Request (Second HTTP Request)&lt;|Artifact|&gt;</data>
  <data key="d1">Artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A secondary HTTP request inserted into buffered data that bypasses normal validation processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-8b6431100fb5694f9e64efa595cebe6c-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">wstg-inpv-16-methodology.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785582540</data>
