  <data key="d0">Dynamic Data Exchange (DDE)</data>
  <data key="d1">TechnologyStack</data>
  <data key="d2">A legacy protocol used by Microsoft office applications that can be abusable through malicious formulas to transmit and execute data from attacker-controlled channels.&lt;SEP&gt;A legacy protocol condition where spreadsheet "gadgets" or links can be exploited after a dangerous CSV export is opened, potentially leading to command execution.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1fdef32ca149cd0b391b755204dc40b2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1fdef32ca149cd0b391b755204dc40b2-chunk-002</data>
