  <data key="d1">DefensiveControl</data>
  <data key="d2">A mechanism that forces web browsers to load HTTPS connections and can add cookie integrity flags.&lt;SEP&gt;A response header instructing browsers to access the web server only over HTTPS for a defined period.</data>
