<node id="Cross Site Request Forgery">
  <data key="d0">Cross Site Request Forgery</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackGoal</data>
  <data key="d2">A weakness in session management where an attacker can induce a user's browser to send unintended requests to a web application.&lt;SEP&gt;An attack that forces the victim's browser to perform unintended state-altering operations on an authenticated web application.&lt;SEP&gt;Unauthorized modification of the victim's session by tricking the web application into processing unauthorized requests.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-35af4670be2579d771f8aacc9dfbff92-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35af4670be2579d771f8aacc9dfbff92-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-35af4670be2579d771f8aacc9dfbff92-chunk-006</data>
