<node id="Script Auto-Submission">
  <data key="d0">Script Auto-Submission</data>
  <data key="d1">AttackTechnique</data>
  <data key="d2">A JavaScript command (often `onload`, `submit()` on form element) that automatically triggers form submission without user action.</data>
